# NOTE: do NOT add `.git` here. `[tool.hatch.version] source = "vcs"` in
# pyproject.toml means hatch-vcs reads the version from git tags during
# the build. Excluding .git here is what caused the 2026-03-04 → present
# deploy failures (hatchling.build.build_editable exit 1 in `uv sync`).
# Multi-stage Dockerfile already keeps .git out of the runtime image.
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.pyright
.ruff_cache
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log
logs/
temp/
tests/
*.md
!README.md
